   "subject": "Error: \"cannot download all files\" after I upload my shiny on shinyapp.io",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I have an app working fine locally but after I upload it on <a href=\"http://shinyapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361144510000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nk_QJpbV2WphAwITZ5F_j\">shinyapp.io</a>, it says &quot;cannot download all files&quot;. <div><br></div><div>I can upload it two weeks earlier and works fine on <a href=\"http://shinyapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361144510000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nk_QJpbV2WphAwITZ5F_j\">shinyapp.io</a> but I didn&#39;t do any major changes and I replace the link with new app but it says error. I am thinking maybe it is because  &quot;webshot::install_phantomjs()&quot; ?<br><div><br></div><div>I am using Windows OS and R version is 3.3.1.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you!</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
